  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      372.47,
      451.17,
      400.53
    ],
    "text": "Clause 3 : This clause amends Part II of the First Schedule to the principal enactmentto exempt certain goods and services from VAT in order to give effect to budget proposalsof 2022.",
