      161.85,
      253.73,
      401.9,
      277.67
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      291.53,
      401.87,
      315.47
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Value Added Tax(Amendment) Act, No. of 2022.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      329.33,
      401.92,
      365.87
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 25C of the Value Added Tax Act, No. 14 of2002 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) ishereby amended in subsection (3) thereof as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      180.57,
      379.73,
      401.88,
      454.07
    ],
    "text": "(1) by the substitution in paragraph (f) of thatsubsection, for the words and figures, \u201ccommencingfrom November 1, 2016, shall be fifteen percentum.\u201d of the words and figures \u201ccommencingfrom November 1, 2016 but ending on or beforeDecember 31, 2021, shall be fifteen per centum;\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      180.57,
      467.93,
      401.85,
      491.87
    ],
    "text": "(2) by the addition immediately after paragraph (f) ofthat subsection of the following:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      199.65,
      505.73,
      401.86,
      529.67
